    },
    {
      "source_sentence": "Generative artificial intelligence (AI) offers methods for estimating PET images from routinely acquired MRI~\\cite{dayarathna2024deep,lee2024synthesizing}.",
      "present_in_accepted_highlight": true
    },
    {
      "source_sentence": "We therefore investigate patient-specific clinical and tracer information as complementary conditioning for MRI-to-PET synthesis.",
      "present_in_accepted_highlight": true
    },
    {
      "source_sentence": "This challenge stems from the inherent nature of MRI-to-PET synthesis as an ill-posed inverse problem; neurodegeneration visible on MRI is typically a downstream effect of prior molecular pathologies captured by PET~\\cite{jagust2018imaging}.",
      "present_in_accepted_highlight": true
    },
    {
      "source_sentence": "We assessed image quality, normalized regional uptake and cross-sectional classification, reporting historical and reconstructed analyses separately.",
      "present_in_accepted_highlight": true
